 "headline": [
  "On nobond_vt08, one sheet filled one open late is worth -932 CNY of NAV at the decision (median over 415 sheets, p10..p90 -10,347..5,907); waiting helped on 41% of them, the mean is -12.2 bps with t=-4.61. The 415 locals add up to the whole-book delay arm to 5e-15 log (residual, not assumed): that arm costs 1.87pp a year -- so the price is real in aggregate but a single late sheet is a coin flip -- budget it, do not argue with it.",
  "On nobond_base, one sheet filled one open late is worth -1,450 CNY of NAV at the decision (median over 415 sheets, p10..p90 -20,639..11,300); waiting helped on 41% of them, the mean is -19.1 bps with t=-4.32. The 415 locals add up to the whole-book delay arm to 3e-15 log (residual, not assumed): that arm costs 3.68pp a year -- so the price is real in aggregate but a single late sheet is a coin flip -- budget it, do not argue with it."
